---
import { CONNECT_SIGNUP } from "../lib/urls";
---

<section class="what" id="rails" data-index="02">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="what__head reveal">
      <span class="kicker">02 — Rails</span>
      <h2>What is KioskPay?</h2>
      <p>
        A single payments surface for shops that already sell on Kiosk. Enter where money should
        land. Malipo moves it. Your till, wallet, and storefront stay in sync.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul class="what__rails reveal">
      <li>
        <strong>STK</strong>
        <span>Prompt lands on the customer phone</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Wallet</strong>
        <span>Balance you can withdraw to M-Pesa</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Card</strong>
        <span>Checkout beside till and paybill</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Keys</strong>
        <span>One request to charge a phone</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="stage stage--dest reveal">
      <article class="stage__copy">
        <h3>Destinations, not Daraja forms</h3>
        <p>
          Merchants never paste consumer keys or passkeys. They pick a till, paybill, or bank
          destination. The platform shortcode collects; settlement follows the destination they
          confirmed.
        </p>
        <a class="stage__link" href={CONNECT_SIGNUP}>Explore</a>
      </article>
      <div class="stage__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="till">
          <div class="till__badge">Verified</div>
          <span class="till__label">Buy goods till</span>
          <strong class="till__num" data-till>3050941</strong>
          <em>Till 3050941 · rail Daraja</em>
          <div class="till__bar"><i></i></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage stage--stk reveal">
      <div class="stage__visual stage__visual--dark" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="phone__notch"></div>
          <div class="phone__screen">
            <span class="phone__from">M-PESA</span>
            <p class="phone__ask">Enter PIN to pay</p>
            <strong class="phone__amt">KES 1,250.00</strong>
            <span class="phone__to">KioskPay · Till 3050941</span>
            <div class="phone__dots" aria-hidden="true">
              <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <article class="stage__copy">
        <h3>Turning payment friction into settled sales</h3>
        <p>
          The hardest part of M-Pesa integration is credential choreography. KioskPay removes it.
          One confirm screen, one test shilling, then live prompts on the till and the storefront.
        </p>
        <a class="stage__link" href={CONNECT_SIGNUP}>Explore</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="closer reveal">
      <div class="closer__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <h3>A one-stop platform for collecting and settling</h3>
      <p>
        Finding the right rail for a Kenyan shop should not mean three portals and a support
        ticket. KioskPay keeps collection, wallet, and withdraw in one place, next to the POS and
        storefront that already know your stock.
      </p>
      <p class="closer__tag">KioskPay is more than a gateway. It is the money path for Kiosk.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-fill" href={CONNECT_SIGNUP}>Join Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0 0 clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  }

  .what__head {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  }

  .what__head .kicker {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .what h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.4vw, 3.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.06;
  }

  .what__head p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .what__rails {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .what__rails li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-fast) ease, background var(--dur-fast) ease;
  }

  .what__rails li:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    background: #fff;
    border-color: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.1);
  }

  .what__rails strong {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .what__rails span {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .stage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.75rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .stage--stk .stage__copy {
    order: 2;
  }

  .stage--stk .stage__visual {
    order: 1;
  }

  .stage__copy h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.1vw, 2.35rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  .stage__copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    max-width: 42ch;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .stage__link {
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.28em;
  }

  .stage__visual {
    min-height: 300px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-media);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(254, 242, 127, 0.45), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg-soft);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .stage__visual--dark {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 10%, rgba(254, 242, 127, 0.18), transparent 45%),
      #111;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .till {
    width: min(100%, 280px);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    animation: till-pop 0.9s var(--ease-out) both;
  }

  .till__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: rgba(15, 107, 104, 0.1);
    color: var(--mpesa);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .till__label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mpesa);
  }

  .till__num {
    display: block;
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 2.15rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .till em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: #6b6b6b;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .till__bar {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .till__bar i {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mpesa), var(--yellow));
    animation: fill-bar 1.6s 0.4s var(--ease-out) forwards;
  }

  .phone {
    width: min(100%, 220px);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.65rem 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    animation: phone-rise 1s var(--ease-out) both;
  }

  .phone__notch {
    width: 42%;
    height: 10px;
    margin: 0.2rem auto 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: #0d0d0d;
  }

  .phone__screen {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: #0f0f0f;
  }

  .phone__from {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .phone__ask {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }

  .phone__amt {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0.2rem 0;
  }

  .phone__to {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .phone__dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .phone__dots i {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    animation: dot-pulse 1.4s var(--ease-in-out) infinite;
  }

  .phone__dots i:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .phone__dots i:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  .phone__dots i:nth-child(4) {
    animation-delay: 0.45s;
  }

  .closer {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    max-width: 48rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .closer__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -40%;
    right: -10%;
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(254, 242, 127, 0.55), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .closer h3 {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.12;
  }

  .closer p {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .closer__tag {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .closer .btn {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @keyframes till-pop {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.96);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @keyframes fill-bar {
    to {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @keyframes phone-rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(24px) rotate(-2deg);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @keyframes dot-pulse {
    0%,
    100% {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      background: var(--yellow);
      transform: scale(1.15);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .what__rails {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .stage,
    .stage--stk {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .stage--stk .stage__copy,
    .stage--stk .stage__visual {
      order: initial;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .what__rails {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
